{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2015-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1431734400, "end_date": 1432425599, "month_true_total": 96, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:50:39 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "15944679", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163260951", "personaname": "PDFMUy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198163260951/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 10358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1610, "last_played": 1718415653, "avatar": "74a4af309be17aa7c1138287a3d0c5301d10cddd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine combines a very good campaign with a decent on-line multiplayer. It has excellent graphics since it’s a 2011 game. Game controls are acceptable but it could be better if it allowed you to use joystick.  The only real bad thing is that multiplayer doesn’t allows you to set up a multiplayer game with friends. Steam should work to improve that.", "timestamp_created": 1432322555, "timestamp_updated": 1432322555, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15937728", "author": {"steamid": "76561198108502368", "personaname": "Keldor Grayskull", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198108502368/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 5041, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3400, "last_played": 1599998273, "avatar": "1f67b2ed0b4cafa0940adfbfe10593156ac3c682"}, "language": "english", "review": "well i don't know what to say. GET THIS GAME!!! I'm a hardcore gamer so you better play this or i'll go all purple guy on ya", "timestamp_created": 1432284186, "timestamp_updated": 1432284186, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15935663", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993788606", "personaname": "Diggler", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WingDiggler/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 2915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1686, "last_played": 1664336755, "avatar": "669bad808e4ee4dcbe49c7edebd9af6acfda3ae5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pros: Excellent graphics, characters, dialogue, sound, gameplay, and story. Multiplayer is decent. Many of the game setpieces are just plain cool. \n\nCons: Enemies can use a lot more variety in their sound clips. If I hear an Ork say \"Spice Mureen!\" one more time, well. Playing with a gamepad is a must: the keyboard doesn't quite do it.\n\nThe Upshot: If you want to know what it is to be a Space Marine in the grimdark future of Warhammer 40k, this is the game for you. Loved the campaign, loved the co-op mode.", "timestamp_created": 1432264553, "timestamp_updated": 1432264553, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15916484", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027230914", "personaname": "slashoom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/slashoom/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1635, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1283, "last_played": 1711605393, "avatar": "66737e7e870bbfa52599de846141eba138ed22fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Campaign is great (when played on hard) and there is an active online community. Co-op can be a ton of fun with friends as it is challenging enough to hold your interest.\n-Highly reccomended for 40k fans", "timestamp_created": 1432140929, "timestamp_updated": 1432140929, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "15909422", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014932787", "personaname": "Rommelish", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thedriftwood/", "num_games_owned": 1001, "num_reviews": 118, "playtime_forever": 725, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 559, "last_played": 1515623365, "avatar": "2d9a70f58d60acc4b57fe92246ee4c6103d2fd7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "You regenerate health by executing enemies in melee combat, instead of hiding behind a wall like a ♥♥♥♥♥ for a few seconds.\n\n...\n\nI really don't think I need to say anything else.", "timestamp_created": 1432090067, "timestamp_updated": 1432090067, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}